  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: (8÷ 2)× 11 −9× 3 + (51÷ 17) × 6 = 30\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 3 and 6\n\n(8÷ 2)× 11 −9× 3 + (51÷ 17) × 6 = 30 ⇒ (8÷ 2)× 11 −9× 6 + (51÷ 17) × 3 = 30\n\n⇒ __**(8÷ 2)**__× 11 −9× 6 + __**(51÷ 17)**__ × 3 = 30\n\n⇒ __**4 × 11**__ −__**9× 6**__ + __**3 × 3**__ = 30\n\n⇒ __**44 + 9**__ − 54 = 30\n\n⇒ __**53 − 54**__ = 30\n\n⇒ -1 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 9 and 11\n\n(8÷ 2)× 11 −9× 3 + (51÷ 17) × 6 = 30 ⇒ (8÷ 2)× 9 − 11 × 3 + (51÷ 17) × 6 = 30\n\n⇒ __**(8÷ 2)**__× 9 − 11 × 3 + __**(51÷ 17)**__ × 6 = 30\n\n⇒ __**4 × 9**__ − __**11 × 3**__ + __**3 × 6**__ = 30\n\n⇒ __**36 + 18**__ − 33 = 30\n\n⇒ __**54 − 33**__ = 30\n\n⇒ 21 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 9 and 6\n\n(8÷ 2)× 11 −9× 3 + (51÷ 17) × 6 = 30 ⇒ (8÷ 2)× 11 − 6 × 3 + (51÷ 17) × 9 = 30\n\n⇒ **__(8÷ 2)__**× 11 − 6 × 3 + __**(51÷ 17)**__ × 9 = 30\n\n⇒ __**4× 11**__ − __**6 × 3**__ + __**3 × 9**__ = 30\n\n⇒ __**44 + 27**__ − 18 = 30\n\n⇒ __**71 − 18**__ = 30\n\n⇒ 53 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 11 and 6\n\n(8÷ 2)× 11 −9× 3 + (51÷ 17) × 6 = 30 ⇒ (8÷ 2)× 6 −9× 3 + (51÷ 17) × 11 = 30\n\n⇒ __**(8÷ 2)**__× 6 −9× 3 + __**(51÷ 17)**__ × 11 = 30\n\n⇒ __**4**____**× 6**__ − __**9× 3**__ + __**3 × 11**__ = 30\n\n⇒ __**24 + 33**__ − 27 = 30\n\n⇒ __**57 − 27**__ = 30\n\n⇒ 30 = 30 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
